   <body>
      <div id="u15_rtf">
         <p style="text-align:left;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:13px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#333333;">&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;&#160; </span><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:13px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#333333;">SURAT NIAT</span></p>
         <p style="text-align:left;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:13px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#333333;">$fileNo - $fileExtnNo</span></p>
         <p style="text-align:left;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:13px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#333333;">$loiNo</span></p>
         <p style="text-align:left;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:13px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#333333;">$supplierName</span></p>
         <p style="text-align:left;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:13px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#333333;">$supplierAddress</span></p>
         <p style="text-align:left;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:13px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#333333;text-decoration:none;">&#160;</span></p>
         <p style="text-align:left;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:13px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#333333;">Tuan,</span></p>
         <p style="text-align:left;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:13px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#333333;">$title</span></p>
         <p style="text-align:left;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:13px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#333333;text-decoration:none;">&#160;</span></p>
         <p style="text-align:left;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:13px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#333333;">Merujuk kepada cadangan tawaran yang tersebut di atas, Kerajaan Malaysia ingin memberitahu tuan bahawa pada amnya terma-terma</span></p>
         <p style="text-align:left;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:13px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#333333;">cadangan tawaran tuan boleh diterima oleh Kerajaan.</span></p>
         <p style="text-align:left;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:13px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#333333;text-decoration:none;">&#160;</span></p>
         <p style="text-align:left;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:13px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#333333;">2. Walau bagaimanapun, Kerajaan tidak dapat menerima cadangan tawaran tuan tanpa</span></p>
         <p style="text-align:left;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:13px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#333333;">perbincangan/rundingan lanjut dengan tuan berhubung dengan terma-terma</span></p>
         <p style="text-align:left;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:13px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#333333;">tertentu untuk kontrak yang dicadangkan itu, terutama terma-terma yang</span></p>
         <p style="text-align:left;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:13px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#333333;">berkenaan dengan perkara-perkara berikut:</span></p>
         <p style="text-align:left;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:13px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#333333;text-decoration:none;">&#160;</span></p>
         <p style="text-align:left;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:13px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#333333;"><table border="1" cellspacing="0" width="100%">
         																																						<thead>
         																																						<tr>
         																																							<th>Item</th>
         																																							<th>Kekerapan / Unit Ukuran</th>
																																									<th>Bil. Unit Ukuran Sehari</th>
																																									<th>Bil Hari utk Sebulan</th>
																																									<th>Tempoh (Bulan)</th>
         																																							<th>Kuantiti</th>
         																																							<th>Unit Ukuran</th>
         																																							<th>Harga Ditawarkan(RM)</th>
         																																							<th>Jumlah Kecil(RM)</th>
         																																						</tr>
         																																						</thead>
         																																						<tbody>
         																																						#foreach( $scLoiLoaItem in $scLoiLoaItems )
         																																						<tr>
         																																							<td>$scLoiLoaItem.scRequestItem.itemName</td>
																																									<td>$scLoiLoaItem.scRequestItem.tplSpecQuestion.clUomFrequency</td>
																																									<td>$scLoiLoaItem.scRequestItem.tplSpecQuestion.clUomPerDay</td>
																																									<td>$scLoiLoaItem.scRequestItem.tplSpecQuestion.clUomPerMonth</td>
																																									<td>$scLoiLoaItem.scRequestItem.tplSpecQuestion.clDurationMonth</td>
         																																							<td align="right">$numberDF.format($scLoiLoaItem.qty)</td>
         																																							<td>$scLoiLoaItem.scRequestItem.uom.uomName</td>
         																																							<td align="right">$amountDF.format($scLoiLoaItem.unitPrice)</td>
         																																							<td align="right">$amountDF.format($scLoiLoaItem.subTotal)</td>
         																																						</tr>
         																																						#end
         																																						</tbody>
         																																					</table></span></p>
         <p style="text-align:left;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:13px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#333333;text-decoration:none;">&#160;</span></p>
         <p style="text-align:left;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:13px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#333333;">Berikut adalah terma terma yang akan di runding:-</span></p>
         <p style="text-align:left;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:13px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#333333;"><ol type="i">
																																							  #foreach( $scNegoTerm in $scNegoTerms )
																																							  <li>$scNegoTerm.termDesc; #if ($scNegoTerm.negoResult) $scNegoTerm.negoResult #else &lt;&lt;Keputusan&gt;&gt; #end</li>
																																							  #end
																																							</ol></span></p>
         <p style="text-align:left;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:13px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#333333;">3. Kerajaan bercadang untuk mengadakan mesyuarat di antara wakil-wakil Kerajaan dengan pihak tuan pada tarikh dan tempat seperti berikut:</span></p>
         <p style="text-align:left;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:13px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#333333;text-decoration:none;">&#160;</span></p>
         <p style="text-align:left;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:13px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#333333;"><table border="1" cellspacing="0" width="100%">
         																																						<thead>
         																																						<tr>
         																																							<th>Tempat</th>
         																																							<th>Masa</th>
         																																							<th>Catatan</th>
         																																						</tr>
         																																						</thead>
         																																						<tbody>
         																																						#foreach( $scNegoLocation in $scNegoLocations )
         																																						<tr>
         																																							<td>$scNegoLocation.negoLocation</td>
         																																							<td>$dateSDF.format($scNegoLocation.negoDate)</td>
         																																							<td>$scNegoLocation.remark</td>
         																																						</tr>
         																																						#end
         																																						</tbody>
         																																					</table></span></p>
         <p style="text-align:left;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:13px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#333333;text-decoration:none;">&#160;</span></p>
         <p style="text-align:left;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:13px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#333333;">4. Jika tuan bersetuju, sila klik butang "Sah" untuk persetujuan rundingan dan pengesahan kehadiran dalam tempoh $ackDueDays hari daripada tarikh surat ini.</span></p>
         <p style="text-align:left;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:13px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#333333;text-decoration:none;">&#160;</span></p>
         <p style="text-align:left;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:13px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#333333;">5. Surat ini adalah RAHSIA KERAJAAN dan tidak boleh disebarkan kepada</span></p>
         <p style="text-align:left;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:13px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#333333;">mana-mana pihak lain.</span></p>
         <p style="text-align:left;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:13px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#333333;text-decoration:none;">&#160;</span></p>
         <p style="text-align:left;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:13px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#333333;">6. Surat ini hanyalah suatu surat niat dan hendaklah tidak ditafsirkan dalam</span></p>
         <p style="text-align:left;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:13px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#333333;">apa-apa cara jua sebagai mengikat Kerajaan.</span></p>
         <p style="text-align:left;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:13px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#333333;text-decoration:none;">&#160;</span></p>
         <p style="text-align:left;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:13px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#333333;text-decoration:none;">&#160;</span></p>
         <p style="text-align:left;"><span style="font-family:Arial;font-size:13px;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#333333;">" BERKHIDMAT UNTUK NEGARA "</span></p>
